<title>FINLAND: TENNIS-FINLAND BEAT GREECE 3-2 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FINLAND BEAT GREECE 3-2 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland beat Greece 3-2 in their Davis Cup Euro/African zone group two, first round tie after winning both singles reverse on Sunday:</p>
<p>Results: Ville Liukko beat Konstantinos Economidis 6-3 6-4 6-4 Kim Tiilikainen beat Anastasios Vasiliadis 6-3 7-6 7-6</p>
</text>
